// SULIT_DEDAH.RII — Secrets and sanctioned declassification (REQ-27)
// Rahsia dan pendedahan yang disahkan
//
// This example CHECKS AND RUNS on the shipped compiler.
//
// `sulit e`            classifies a value (Coq: T_Classify -> TSecret)
// `cetak(<secret>)`    is a COMPILE ERROR — secrets cannot reach a print sink
// `dedah e dengan bukti e`  declassifies with a matching proof (Coq: T_Declassify
//                      with declass_ok; Declassification.v) — only then printing
//                      is allowed.
//
// The rejected counterpart (try it — `riinac check` fails with
// "Security violation in print sink"):
//
//     biar pin = sulit 1234;
//     cetak(pin)

fungsi utama() -> Unit kesan Tulis {
    cetak(dedah (sulit 1234) dengan bukti (sulit 1234))
}
